<metadata><name>Snowlands 1104 Blue Creek Point Loop</name><desc>lollipop (stem back from waypoint 2) + spur to 5. 5.5 miles round trip. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/11/1104_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
